# ==============================================================================
# Local AI Gateway - Zero-Configuration Setup (No secrets required)
# ==============================================================================
# The gateway starts out-of-the-box with sensible defaults for local development.
# No environment variables or API keys are required to connect your iPhone.
#
# OPTIONAL CONFIGURATION (Only set if you wish to override default behavior):
# GATEWAY_PORT=8080
# OLLAMA_URL=http://127.0.0.1:11434
# DEFAULT_MODEL=llama3.2:3b
#
# OPTIONAL SECURITY OVERRIDES:
# GATEWAY_API_KEY=your_optional_secret_token_here
# PAIRING_CODE=YOUR_STATIC_PAIRING_CODE

